<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has intensified rhetoric, claiming the United States is not serious about talks, while the United States warned Baghdad it will strike Iraqi militias that join Iran's war. Iraq closed the Iran border crossing, sparking protests and turning the Al-Sheeb crossing into a contested corridor, and security forces raided the home of the Maysan provincial council chief for defying the closure. PKK-linked Yazidi militia units are disarming and joining the Iraqi army, and three militia groups have agreed to disarm by June 2027. Oil exports have returned to pre-war levels and a vessel caught fire off the Al-Faw coast. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/27/iran-war-live-iran-says-us-not-serious-on-talks-ship-on-fire-off-iraq?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNUzJDUXRkNklTTk5rVi1JVVhCSWZDb1U3aGUzNDBBeWRZVXhNbHkta0tmcmNFNnpnZ2hJWGVEaWhTNDc3QTMxeFBhTFR3Q3hLZkwzb09lcXNVRzFQd093dmxqc0xzT2x5T05ZVkUtNTFTd0VSd1RGLXd4THlDN2hjUVk1UEZBV1BDUHRYR0lsUmtZUDNpbVFfc2FqMjZ5aTQxRWVNeUNuUkJUM2plT3RwbFV5WG9hTzFGcTBr?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNRlRGdVI4SjN0SnR5OEFWN1VhNVN3WXRNb000cF9ySncydmd5aU9sTFEzSlZ3dFNsblRESDVKTU1hMktDcmFFR2ZqWWdoVVBEcHk5bXlWS0g3SjlIYkhaeVhLemVpYTd0QWlodjluTTg0cTQwUDNSaTVoQmk5bWxUM0t0cTdFZTNyajVOaGxUZXowTHQ0YjFFM0kzcXRheThGSW9hNDFsdDFnNGl1eHNjZXVwN2FybmVWbW9CMXo1Q2tvYzc0ZXJQNA?